{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act31side_level_act31side_05_end",
  "groupId": "act31side",
  "stageId": "act31side_05",
  "title": "紡綾羅",
  "storyCode": "HS-5",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act31side/level_act31side_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f2c5a7e98d517e17028d504c94d426303df8a8e0c0d8da6135ec7ac0e381c59f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "就像是做夢一樣。\n她走過了很長一段路，在冰天雪地中翻山越嶺，路的盡頭是一片望不到邊際的稻田。\n豐碩的稻穗像金子一樣，黃燦燦的。不知是誰把它們種在了這裡，不知為何它們能在這裡長得如此繁盛。\n真好啊。\n“就留在這裡吧。”\n她聽到有一個聲音在呼喚她。\n不……不。\n她還記得，自己還有沒做完的事，自己還有要回去的地方。\n她拾起一株稻穗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "模糊的身影揮舞著鋤頭，將一粒粒種子埋進地裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "您回來了？！太好了，大家都在等您呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "您這次走了好久，路上還順利嗎？有沒有找到想找的莊稼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "老師……您還好嗎？您看起來有點……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "這……這是什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "救命——救命！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1240_1",
      "text": "小禾？你怎麼還在這？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "我查到了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "污染……不是跟著洪水過來的，污染源應該在地下才對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "現在集合天師府的人手，把握時間開始研究應該還來得及！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1240_1",
      "text": "別研究了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1240_1",
      "text": "已經決定了，要放棄這些地了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "不會耽誤太多時間的！可能只要兩三天，我就能鎖定污染來源，肯定會有解決辦法的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "大荒城每一厘田地都來之不易，我們都還沒有努力過，怎麼能說放棄就放棄了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1240_1",
      "text": "不是幾片地塊，是整座大荒城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "什麼……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1240_1",
      "text": "明天之前，所有人都要搬到核心城上去，跟著核心城向東遷移，其他田地就丟在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1240_1",
      "text": "其他天師都在著手組織大家搬家的事，這才是現在最要緊的事……你也去幫忙吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "這是……誰的主意？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1240_1",
      "text": "能下令讓一城搬遷的，你覺得呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "為什麼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "這些試驗田，還有這些才種下去的作物……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "今年已經是荒年，如果再放棄這些莊稼，會有多少人餓肚子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "……就像回到以前的時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1240_1",
      "text": "我們盡力了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1240_1",
      "text": "儘早將人力撤走，儘早準備災後應對措施。你是天師府的天師，別在這種時候分不清——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "神話是真的……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1240_1",
      "text": "說什麼傻話……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "河北岸的凍土，藏著什麼東西？就是它們污染了土地，對不對？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1240_1",
      "text": "就當是一場天災。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1240_1",
      "text": "多少年來，我們保護不了的東西還少嗎……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "大家不會走的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "這是我們的土地，不弄明白這裡到底發生了什麼，大家都不會走的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "神農能把這些敵人擋在家園外面，我們也能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1240_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "是幻覺嗎？\n眼前廣闊的田地瞬間變得荒蕪。\n不，不是田地荒蕪，而是這一方天地都被另一片空間侵噬，這已不是人們熟悉的土地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "那邊是怎麼回事？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1240_1",
      "text": "來不及了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受驚的農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "黍姑娘，剛才那到底是什麼東西……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受驚的農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "老師她……生病了嗎？她為什麼會變成這副模樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "text": "把她，安葬了吧……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一具瘦削的身軀倒在冷硬的土地上，單薄的衣衫口袋裡，裝著一小袋種子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受驚的農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "這是她帶回來的種子？她找到傳說中的種子了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受驚的農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "這兩年收成實在不好，有了這袋種子，說不定還有希望……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受驚的農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "我們把它帶回去……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2014_nian_1",
      "text": "邪魔的污染，為什麼在地下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2014_nian_1",
      "text": "天機閣不是在外邊守著？那些污染物是怎麼繞過老傢伙跑進來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天機閣天師",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2014_nian_1",
      "text": "根據現在的觀測結果推算，這裡的污染物早在還沒有天機閣的時候就已經存在了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天機閣天師",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2014_nian_1",
      "text": "這片土地的地下，已經被高度侵染了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2014_nian_1",
      "text": "但這麼多年來邪魔影響都沒有擴散，是因為她在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2014_nian_1",
      "text": "可為什麼現在這個時候……她難道……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天機閣天師",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2014_nian_1",
      "text": "災難來源，天機閣大抵已有判斷。但當務之急是應對眼下危機。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天機閣天師",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2014_nian_1",
      "text": "這次邪魔災害的影響前所未有，情況在天機閣所有預案之外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2014_nian_1",
      "text": "你們天機閣的天師竟然主動找我……現在還有什麼辦法？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天機閣天師",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2014_nian_1",
      "text": "北岸天機閣全線後撤，同時將對邪魔的防線向南後撤五十公里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天機閣天師",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2014_nian_1",
      "text": "丟棄一切地塊，只撤離核心城，之後需要你協助啟動核心城的部分防禦功能，以核心城為屏障重新設立防線。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2014_nian_1",
      "text": "這個方案，聽起來沒有討論犧牲人數對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天機閣天師",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2014_nian_1",
      "text": "邪魔穢物不比一般的災害，務必當斷則斷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2014_nian_1",
      "text": "可沒看過大炎做這麼消極的判斷，這是誰的命令？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2014_nian_1",
      "text": "……是你們的上頭，那個見首不見尾的老天師的意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天機閣天師",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2014_nian_1",
      "text": "聽命行事即可，勿要多問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2014_nian_1",
      "text": "你在看什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "text": "……她為什麼要這麼做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2014_nian_1",
      "text": "她大概是真的捨不得這裡吧……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2014_nian_1",
      "text": "如果早在那個時候，邪魔就已經污染到這片土地的下面……這麼多年，全靠她在壓制著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2014_nian_1",
      "text": "一千年……意識被邪魔啃噬了整整一千年，會是什麼感覺……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2014_nian_1",
      "text": "這個姐姐……真是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "text": "現在沒有別的辦法了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2014_nian_1",
      "text": "我們也無能為力，你不能用一張畫把這裡的人全都帶走，我也沒辦法憑空造一座可以運走所有人的城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "text": "那，她呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2014_nian_1",
      "text": "什麼意思……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "text": "她難道會不知道，遲早有這麼一天嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "text": "她現在……在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1240_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "哭聲。\n哭聲從很遠的地方傳來，是嬰兒啼哭，老人啜泣幽咽，田裡的莊稼也在悲鳴。\n彷彿是四十年前的一幕。\n那也是一個荒年。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "text": "你是……從司歲台來的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "text": "我的能力，人們沒辦法復現。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "text": "我救了這一次，之後人們便只會想著這樣的“神蹟”如何才能再發生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "text": "可我做不到每一次都能救下所有……總有一天，我會消失不見的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "text": "到那時，我現在用的力量，只會變成害人的“惡因”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "text": "我能做的的確不多……只是把過去的經驗記下來，告訴後來的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "text": "災年過去，總會有豐年，人們總得靠自己來扛過這一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "text": "你會在這裡留多久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "text": "等今年收穫的時候，你會看到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "text": "對了，你下過地嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "text": "現在正是插秧的時候，大家都忙得很，能不能請你來幫個忙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "text": "你笑了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "text": "給司歲台的記錄上，還準備打我的小報告嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "text": "我曾經有一個朋友，和你很像。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1240_1",
      "text": "黍……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "房間是空的。\n桌上還留有一碗溫熱的湯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1240_1",
      "text": "你……原來早就……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "下雨了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "田邊的職農",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1250_1",
      "text": "下雨了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "農人抬起頭，看到一縷輕薄的雲層遮住了天邊的新月，不一會，幾滴清涼的雨水便落了下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "田邊的職農",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1250_1",
      "text": "那是誰……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "遠處，有一人向農田深處走去。\n她在荒蕪的田地上走過，足跡踏過的地方，生出些許綠意。\n“喂，你要上哪去？”\n她沒有應答，只是向前走去。\n她越走越遠，身影在一聲夏雷中消散。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不同於幾日前的那場暴雨，此時的雨水竟是那樣細密、柔和。\n雨水落下，土地的皸裂盡數褪去。\n一個被禁錮了千年的遊魂在此時消散。\n萬物生長。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "老師？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "下雨了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "text": "果然……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "像是墨跡被水暈開，包含這一方天地的畫卷逐漸消失無蹤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "怎麼回事？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "text": "差一點啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "text": "左公子，在下的確無意與你為敵。剛才說過的話，只希望左公子記得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "text": "來日方長，我們還會有再見面的時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "text": "……到頭來還是這樣，和我說的一點不差。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "text": "姐姐……這些人類，離開了你，什麼都做不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "text": "好好休息一會吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "text": "等你醒來的時候，一切都會好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
